  "caveats": [
    "After transaction friction (0.04% taker + 18% GST equivalent) and Bonferroni multi-hypothesis adjustment, SPY buy-and-hold and Equal-Weight beat long-only factor tilts on a risk-adjusted basis.",
    "Strategy T (Momentum) suffered a severe maximum drawdown of -38.30% (and -29.36% in 2022).",
    "Tightened clustered standard errors reduced surviving interaction cells from 12 down to only 4 out of 170 (2.35%), and the surviving cells are isolated across distinct pairs without contiguous cluster support.",
    "Belief 1 ('Undervalued stocks rarely fall more than 2-3%') is empirically refuted: 49.5% fall >3% in 21 days, and mean 1-year fall is -14.75%.",
    "Belief 2 ('Undervalued stocks rocket if they go up') is not supported: 28.92% rocket >30% (virtually identical to the equal-weight base rate of 28.38%)."
  ]
